#===============================================================================
# @TYPE:       s1-tddft-opt
# @FUNCTIONAL: CAM-B3LYP
# @BASIS:      6-31G(d)
# @SOLVENT:    CPCM(Methanol)
# @ORCA:       6.1.0
# @CHARGE:     1
# @MULT:       1
# @SYSTEM:     closed-shell organic chromophore
# @VERIFIED:   PENDING
#===============================================================================
# CAM-B3LYP has native TD-DFT analytical gradient support in ORCA 6.1.
# No PBE decoy, no LibXC Functional 106, no D3BJ workaround needed.
# TDA is used for stability during excited-state geometry optimization.
#===============================================================================

! Opt CAM-B3LYP RIJCOSX 6-31G(d) CPCM(Methanol)
! TightOpt
! TightScf

%maxcore 3072

%pal
   nprocs 16
end

%tddft
  nroots 5
  iroot 1
  tda   true
end

* xyz 1 1
  <INSERT S0 OPTIMIZED GEOMETRY HERE>
*